<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no" ?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="5">

  <Content>
    <Paragraph Label="Scene 1" Type="New Act">
      <Text>Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text>Abyssal Sanctuary</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="1" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ADRIENNE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUY &amp; ADRIENNE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">1. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Life Before (The End of the World)</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The sanctuary is deep in an unknown abyss. The deep-sea community lives beyond the transparent back wall of it. There is a miniature scale of the sanctuary stationed within the space.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Adrienne</Text>
      <Text> idly sits while </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Thuy</Text>
      <Text> stares out into the dark sea.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy &amp; Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Life...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>In 2006, things were simple.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Scientists like me had to wonder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>As high tides engulfed the coastlines.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I had to plan for going under.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I crunched numbers, double-checked.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>And then all my bosses would deflect.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Of course, no one could suspect:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>the end of the world!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>IN 2009, I WAS WEALTHY.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>HAVING FUNDS PASSED DOWN AS AN HEIR.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>WHEN THUY TOLD ME ALL ABOUT THIS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I SUDDENLY HAD CASH TO SPARE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>SURE, I COULD PASS OUT A DOZEN CHECKS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I NEEDED A HOBBY MORE COMPLEX.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>OF COURSE, THEN WHAT HAPPENS NEXT?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THE END OF THE WORLD.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY &amp; Adrienne</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>LIFE BEFORE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>There’s so much to explore since</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY &amp; Adrienne</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>LIFE BEFORE.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Now life is such a chore</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY &amp; Adrienne</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>We fish for food, refill the gas</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>To stay alive.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>At least, IT'S PRETTY BEHIND THE GLASS.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>THUY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>The waves came crashing down and</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>We made this tiny town and
at least we didn't drown.</Text>
          <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character">
          <Text>Adrienne</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
          <Text>Life before
life before</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY &amp; Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Life before</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THE END OF THE WORLD.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">(Life Before) The End of the World</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Puppet BABY GIANT SQUIDS swim by, greeting THUY.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>2012 has taken so much away from us!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>2012 has given so much to us, Adrienne.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I have no funds left.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Fun is inversely proportional to money!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Funds are proportional to sanity. You're insane.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to BABY GIANT SQUIDS)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Am I insane? Ink if "yes." Don't if "no."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The BABY GIANT SQUIDS do not ink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>See?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yes... The sea is everything to you...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I don’t think you realize how lucky we are down here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I’ve realized plenty, living with you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(THUY looks at the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">squids</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Guys, I think to—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="7" Page="3" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ADRIENENE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ADRIENNE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BABY SQUIDS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOSES">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUY, BABY SQUIDS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUY, SQUIDS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">2. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Colossal Breakthrough</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Adrienne</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Don’t sing the squid song.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well future generations are going to wonder about these guys.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I don’t know if you noticed but there are no generations to be had!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>ALLOW ME TO INTRODUCE TO YOU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THE SUBJECTS OF MY STUDIES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THEY’RE CALLED ARCHITEUTHIS (arch - E - T - tus)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BUT I CALL THEM MY BUDDIES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>DISCOVERED BACK IN 2012</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THEY LIVE WITH US IN THE DEEP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THEY GROW TO 13 METERS LONG</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>8 TIMES THE SIZE OF THE AVERAGE JEEP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(The SQUIDS mimic a car horn with THUY)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BEEP, BEEP</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>How much more wine do we got?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(ADRIENNE crosses to exit)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THEY’RE MY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY, BABY SQUIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>COLOSSAL (*SQUIDS blow raspberries in harmony)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BREAKTHROUGH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>MY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY, BABY SQUIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>GIGANTIC (*SQUIDS blow raspberries in harmony)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BRAND NEW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>SPECIES THAT I HAVE KEPT SAFE AND WARM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>IN THEIR NEVER-BEFORE-SEEN BABY FORM</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Do you wanna know some fun facts?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(Offstage)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Are we out of white?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(Rap)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>GIANTS SQUIDS ARE KNOWN TO EAT ALL KINDS OF FISH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>ANY DEEP WATER FRIEND THEY CAN MAKE INTO A DISH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>GESTATION PERIODS ARE LIKE ALL THE AVERAGE SQUIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BUT FEMALE OOCYTES CAN HOLD 4 MILLION KIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>SO ALL THESE LARGE CUTIES ARE NOT HERE TO FRIGHTEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>They’re JUST CEPHALOPODS MADE OF MANTLES AND CHITIN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>AND IN THIS UNDERWATER WONDERLAND THAT WE ALL roam</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>IT’S CREATURES LIKE THESE THAT MAKE IT FEEL LIKE HOME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Adrienne, do you think kids would know what chitin is in the future?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>No response.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Adrienne?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>No response. THUY shrugs and counts off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THEY’RE MY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THUY, BABY SQUIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>COLOSSAL (*SQUIDS blow raspberries in harmony)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BREAKTHROUGH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>MY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY, SQUIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>ENORMOUS (*SQUIDS blow raspberries in harmony)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>SQUISHY CREW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>AND I GUARANTEE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BABY SQUIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>GUARANTEE (*SQUIDS blow raspberries in harmony)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>YOU’LL LOVE THEM AS MUCH AS I DO!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>BABY SQUIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>COLOSSAL (*SQUIDS blow raspberries in harmony)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BREAKTHROUGH</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>MY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>ENORMOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>SQUISHY CREW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>One BABY SQUID scats.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Colossal Discovery</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>2012 is the end of our lives. 2013 is the end of our world.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>2023 meters is how far down this sanctuary is stationed. I can spout numbers, too!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>THUY lovingly swipes at ADRIENNE with peace-signed fingers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Get out of my zone!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It takes a thousand meters higher or deeper to get out of the bathypelagic zone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I get it... I should have invested in the construction of a sanctuary at the photic zone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Yup. You were so adamant that yachts would come across our home.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Peasants.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Now look at us. We're rich in life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The BABY GIANT SQUIDS play around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Unpleasant. If I had the chance to reinvest in Netflix, I'd pitch a game show where you face hoards of squids.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to BABY GIANT SQUIDS)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Who would win? Y'all or me?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The BABY GIANT SQUIDS ink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I'd ink too if I could! Alright, fight me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh Thuy. What will I do with you...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Squids, give me your death blow!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">

Scene 2</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>MOSES enters, holding a miniature submarine. They ramp the submarine into the miniature habitat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The BABY GIANT SQUIDS scurry off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Am I in the afterlife?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I'll take you there! What the Hell, bud?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hold up, Thuy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You're always held up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You hold up. What are you two doing down in the abyss?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Surviving. You?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Personally, thriving.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Where did you come from?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Reno.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Even the tsunamis got Reno.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Tsunamis?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Quit flooding us with questions.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Give us some answers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Why don't you check it out for yourself? Come up to the shores.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No way.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No way?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>No way out. We're stuck here.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Everyone’s dead anyways.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We’re dead inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well, get this through your empty heads: the world did not end!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>What?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>December 21 is a myth. There are no worldwide tsunamis.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But the world went crazy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You're the one who's gone crazy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Who invested in my crazy?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Crazies help crazies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Look, let's deal with this Twenty Thousand Leagues Under the Sea situation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That explorer is twenty thousand meters out of your league.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Speaking of the monster in that book... I was here under the impression that there was a giant squid around, not a giant sanctuary? Who funded this?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I did.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Adrienne... Adrienne Harbor?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You fund the contractors that build submarine parts that I assemble and use. Cheap.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>But not efficient.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I funded this underwater sanctuary since 2009, with some sketchy former naval personnel who constructed the past SEALABs. I ran out of money by the time we got around to the escape pod.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The baby giant squids toyed around with it. They thought it was another giant squid with its single window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That escape pod you're talking about may be the one found in the Pacific giant trash patch.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Great Pacific Garbage Patch?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The world may not be over, but it is still trash.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Will you look at that? There is nothing of value to return to.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Wait. I can take you up. You have got to try the goldfish mac and cheese.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Goldfishes are abominations... but with mac and cheese, it's an atrocity!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I'm done with canned mac and cheese. I miss being in the wheatfields with cows.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We will not kowtow to you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I will, the second we reach land.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>That's the spirit! I will surface you to the heavens!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I don’t care that you’re an angel investor. There's no money in the new life you'd have.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There is no life in this hellscape.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I love our time here. You’re the only human friend I have.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You'd love our time anywhere. I don’t feel like a human. I am no friend.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I guess you two are busy. I'll swing back-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Stay!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The BABY GIANT SQUIDS return.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Oh sure, you'll listen when Adrienne says: "stay."</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Make a choice: the squids or I bid you adieu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Should Thuy stay? Ink if yes, don’t if no.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The BABY GIANT SQUIDS do not ink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Moses</Text>
      <Text>)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You're the first person we've had contact with!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We've made many friends.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>The squids are not your friends.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>THUY crosses away, hearing a BABY SQUID whimpering.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Adrienene</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Moses is giving us an opportunity to get out of this and you’re not going?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>#7’s mantle looks damaged. The scuba suits in the back are charged, right?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Look at me when I’m talking to you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>#7 needs my help.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I need you to listen to me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I HAVE!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 1/8" Page="10" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ADRIENNE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ADRIENNE &amp; MOSES">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="KAREN THE KRAKEN">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="MOSES">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="THUY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="TIDAL[S]">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">3. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Waste of Time</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I have through your incessant whining and badgering me about useless nonsense that’s still up there for the taking if you want it. But I can do something different.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>DO YOU KNOW HOW MUCH WASTE THERE IS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>IN THE OCEAN, EVEN NOW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>8 MILLIONS TONS OF DEBRIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>EVERY YEAR, WHAT WE ALLOW</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>ONE DEGREE THAT’S ALL IT TAKES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>FOR THE WORLD TO GO TO HELL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>AND THAT’S ALL ON YOUR HANDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>AS AN EMPTY CORPORATE SHELL</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>SO FORGIVE ME FOR BEING ANXIOUS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>FORGIVE ME FOR BEING SMART</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>FORGIVE ME FOR NOT WANTING TO STAND BY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>AND ACTIVELY PLAY A PART</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>IN THE WASTE OF TIME IT ALL IS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>A WASTE OF TIME YOURS AND HIS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BECAUSE WE ALL JUST SCREW UP IN THE END</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I THOUGHT I COULD TRUST MY BEST FRIEND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I am your best friend, Thuy. I’m doing this for you, too!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You don’t even like the squids and they need me! Their mother left them with the floods. 4 million of them orphaned and alone with no one above looking after them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>You know what you’re right.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>IT’S A WASTE OF TIME IT ALL IS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>BUT I’M NOT SOME CORPORATE WHIZ</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I’M YOUR FRIEND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>AND YOU’RE NOT SLEEPING WITH THE FISHES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>YOU CAN MAKE A LIFE A NEW PLACE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>SOMEONE’S UP THERE AND THEY MISS YOUR FACE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>THERE MUST BE SOMEONE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>NO, NO, YOU’RE NOT MY FRIEND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>SUCH A WASTE OF TIME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>A WASTE OF TIME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>A WASTE OF TIME</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>She’s dead!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>Beat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>Thuy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>On the... the day we left I... got the call. I couldn’t even be there. I couldn’t and now she—</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>ADRIENNE hugs THUY. The BABY SQUID observes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>IT’S NOT A WASTE OF TIME TO LIVE ON</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>YOU CAN THRIVE WHILE SHE’S GONE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>JUST LOOK WHAT YOU CAN DO</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>I’M NOT LEAVING WITHOUT YOU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>THUY looks at </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="AllCaps">Adrienne</Text>
      <Text> and nods.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>AdRIENNE</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics">
      <Text>Oh, thank God! Moses! We’re good.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Aw yeah!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#00000000FEFE" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Waste of Time</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Underline">”</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 3</Text>
      <Text></Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>THUY and ADRIENNE join MOSES’s side. They prepare to ascend.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>The BABY GIANT SQUIDS excessively ink.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>KAREN THE KRAKEN emerges and damages the submarine. A puppeteer in a squid suit grabs ahold of the miniature submarine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mama is back?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Mama?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Karen is cranky!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>KAREN THE KRAKEN gives off a raspy sound to communicate. They release textual ink or the puppeteer holds up written signs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KAREN THE KRAKEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Who will take my kids to water polo practice?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I would love to look after your babies.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Shut up, Moses.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KAREN THE KRAKEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>I need Thuy, the world’s best squid-sitter!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>It is the parent’s responsibility to look after their children.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KAREN THE KRAKEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Don’t tell me how to parent, Harbor.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Hey Karen the Kraken. I know the feelings you harbor. It’s hard to be a mother of four million babies. But you can pull through.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Four million babies?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Have you ever listened to my squid song?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical">
      <Text>(to KAREN THE KRAKEN)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Look, wine solves everything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>We left a century's worth of stockpile in the sanctuary.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Don’t tell her that!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Were you planning to go back and get it? Make a choice.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>KAREN THE KRAKEN goes to the miniature sanctuary and looks inside.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>KAREN THE KRAKEN</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>This will last me the week.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Well, our sub is weakened and </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style="">inoperational</Text>
      <Text> and will not surface due to damages sustained to it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE &amp; MOSES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Thanks Karen...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action">
      <Text>KAREN THE KRAKEN grabs the bottle of wine from the miniature sanctuary. The puppeteer drinks a miniature bottle. They lift the miniature submarine high.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>THUY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Thank you, Karen!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>ADRIENNE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>There is life after.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading">
      <SceneProperties Length="5/8" Page="13" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="ADRIENNE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
              <Text AdornmentStyle="0" Background="#FFFFFFFFFFFF" Color="#000000000000" Font="Courier Final Draft" RevisionID="0" Size="12" Style=""></Text>
            </Paragraph>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COMPANY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No">
